{"id":"ae3d646bcf00672a","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-stone-topology.md","title":"Stone Topology","display":"df-stone-topology — Stone Topology","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-stone-topology","aliases":["58-df-stone-topology","Stone Topology"],"display":"df-stone-topology — Stone Topology","depends_on":["[[58-df-boolean-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-stone-topology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-stone-topology</span><span>Stone Topology</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-stone-topology — Stone Topology"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"58-df-boolean-algebra\">58-df-boolean-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\">\\((B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\)</span> (Boolean algebra)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\">\\(\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\)</span> (Boolean-algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"58-df-boolean-algebra\">58-df-boolean-algebra</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ult}_B\">\\(\\operatorname{Ult}_B\\)</span> (Boolean-algebra ultrafilter set defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_B(a)\">\\(s_B(a)\\)</span> (basic clopen determined by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in B\">\\(a\\in B\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Ult}(B))\">\\(\\tau_B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Ult}(B))\\)</span> (topology candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StoneTopology}_S(B,\\tau_B)\">\\(\\operatorname{StoneTopology}_S(B,\\tau_B)\\)</span> (Stone-topology predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}topology\\text{-}ultrafilters} \\vdash \\operatorname{Ult}_B\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{u\\subseteq B:1\\in u\\land0\\notin u\\land\\forall a,b\\in u\\;(a\\wedge b\\in u)\\land\\forall a\\in u\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;(a\\wedge b=a\\to b\\in u)\\land\\forall a\\in B\\;(a\\in u\\lor\\neg a\\in u)\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}topology\\text{-}ultrafilters} \\vdash \\operatorname{Ult}_B\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{u\\subseteq B:1\\in u\\land0\\notin u\\land\\forall a,b\\in u\\;(a\\wedge b\\in u)\\land\\forall a\\in u\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;(a\\wedge b=a\\to b\\in u)\\land\\forall a\\in B\\;(a\\in u\\lor\\neg a\\in u)\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}topology\\text{-}base} \\vdash s_B\\in\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Ult}_B)^B\\land\\forall a\\in B\\;\\bigl(s_B(a)=\\{u \\in \\operatorname{Ult}_B \\mid a \\in u\\}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}topology\\text{-}base} \\vdash s_B\\in\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Ult}_B)^B\\land\\forall a\\in B\\;\\bigl(s_B(a)=\\{u \\in \\operatorname{Ult}_B \\mid a \\in u\\}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\operatorname{StoneTopology}_S(B,\\tau_B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\land\\tau_B=\\{U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ult}_B:\\forall u\\in U\\;\\exists a\\in B\\;(u\\in s_B(a)\\land s_B(a)\\subseteq U)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\operatorname{StoneTopology}_S(B,\\tau_B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\land\\tau_B=\\{U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ult}_B:\\forall u\\in U\\;\\exists a\\in B\\;(u\\in s_B(a)\\land s_B(a)\\subseteq U)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Stone representation: Boolean algebra <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\">\\(\\to\\)</span> clopen sets on compact Hausdorff space</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ult}_B\">\\(\\operatorname{Ult}_B\\)</span> is defined by the Boolean operations; it is not the unrelated ultrafilter-on-a-set predicate.</li>\n<li>Compactness, Hausdorffness, zero-dimensionality, and the isomorphism <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\cong\\operatorname{Clopen}(\\operatorname{Ult}(B))\">\\(B\\cong\\operatorname{Clopen}(\\operatorname{Ult}(B))\\)</span> are conclusions of Stone representation, not defining clauses for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_B\">\\(\\tau_B\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Stone space: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> zero-dimensional compact; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B \\cong \\operatorname{Clopen}(X)\">\\(B \\cong \\operatorname{Clopen}(X)\\)</span></li>\n<li>Examples: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{P}(S)\">\\(\\mathcal{P}(S)\\)</span> gives the Stone-Cech compactification of the discrete space <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>; finite <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> recovers the discrete space.</li>\n<li>Duality: Boolean algebras <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leftrightarrow\">\\(\\leftrightarrow\\)</span> zero-dimensional compact spaces; Stone duality</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Halmos, Lectures on Boolean Algebras</li>\n<li>Givant and Halmos, Introduction to Boolean Algebras</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a5e10857074b912e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-boolean-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a5e10857074b912e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)$ (Boolean-algebra predicate, see [[58-df-boolean-algebra]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ult}_B","display":false},{"tex":"s_B(a)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in B","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Ult}(B))","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StoneTopology}_S(B,\\tau_B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}topology\\text{-}ultrafilters} \\vdash \\operatorname{Ult}_B\\coloneqq\\Bigl\\{u\\subseteq B:1\\in u\\land0\\notin u\\land\\forall a,b\\in u\\;(a\\wedge b\\in u)\\land\\forall a\\in u\\;\\forall b\\in B\\;(a\\wedge b=a\\to b\\in u)\\land\\forall a\\in B\\;(a\\in u\\lor\\neg a\\in u)\\Bigr\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}topology\\text{-}base} \\vdash s_B\\in\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Ult}_B)^B\\land\\forall a\\in B\\;\\bigl(s_B(a)=\\{u \\in \\operatorname{Ult}_B \\mid a \\in u\\}\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stone\\text{-}topology} \\vdash \\operatorname{StoneTopology}_S(B,\\tau_B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1)\\land\\tau_B=\\{U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ult}_B:\\forall u\\in U\\;\\exists a\\in B\\;(u\\in s_B(a)\\land s_B(a)\\subseteq U)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\to","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ult}_B","display":false},{"tex":"B\\cong\\operatorname{Clopen}(\\operatorname{Ult}(B))","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_B","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"B \\cong \\operatorname{Clopen}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{P}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\leftrightarrow","display":false}],"bytes":2346,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1231","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-stone-topology.md|58-df-stone-topology]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["a5e10857074b912e"]}